  "purpose": "Static VM bank (RG6/WG3, NW/NE) for the 833.333 ps a1 engine clock: wdecode+CE successor plus (1) sticky fault as a registered 2-level tree (gate reg->reg -71 ps ended at flt), (2) local reset relay (async assert, 3-edge sync release; port drives 3 flops only; gate in->reg -54.2 ps rq_v reset recovery). Same 3 actual SRAMs, slots, read n+6 / commit n+3 / egress n+1, pin ABI. Status fault visibility +2 edges; reset release is initialization mode (+3 edges before the first compiler slot).",
